  "kind": "conditional abstract fundamental-domain theorem",
  "statement": "A countable faithful rational linear group acting over a strong polyhedral domain on the base cone admits a rational polyhedral weak domain with finite stabilizer on the exact real total cone when its fibres are the images of the stipulated rational positive semidefinite pencil and its base kernel is a finite extension of a full lattice acting by that pencil. The theorem includes all rational-kernel faces and does not presume a split crystallographic extension. Application to the projective-fibration target retains all geometric obligations below.",
